 "lines": [
  {
   "line": 1,
   "text": "This girl looked terrified of his face...",
   "start": 0.06,
   "end": 2.1
  },
  {
   "line": 2,
   "text": "then came back to buy him cake.",
   "start": 2.4,
   "end": 4.058
  },
  {
   "line": 3,
   "text": "Rintaro is tall, blond, pierced, and so intimidating that strangers run from him.",
   "start": 4.558,
   "end": 8.501
  },
  {
   "line": 4,
   "text": "Which isn't great when your family owns a cake shop.",
   "start": 8.741,
   "end": 11.126
  },
  {
   "line": 5,
   "text": "So when he spots a girl demolishing a mountain of cake, he can't help staring.",
   "start": 11.366,
   "end": 15.34
  },
  {
   "line": 6,
   "text": "She locks eyes with him and bolts out the door.",
   "start": 15.58,
   "end": 17.795
  },
  {
   "line": 7,
   "text": "He's sure he's traumatized her for life.",
   "start": 18.145,
   "end": 20.16
  },
  {
   "line": 8,
   "text": "But the next day she's back, apologizing and insisting on buying him a slice.",
   "start": 20.4,
   "end": 24.379
  },
  {
   "line": 9,
   "text": "So he asks,",
   "start": 24.619,
   "end": 25.311
  },
  {
   "line": 10,
   "text": "\"Wait,",
   "start": 25.451,
   "end": 25.701
  },
  {
   "line": 11,
   "text": "didn't you run because you were scared of me?\"",
   "start": 25.841,
   "end": 27.791
  },
  {
   "line": 12,
   "text": "from HER side, that look was never fear.",
   "start": 29.045,
   "end": 31.726
  },
  {
   "line": 13,
   "text": "No guy had ever stared at her before,",
   "start": 31.986,
   "end": 34.131
  },
  {
   "line": 14,
   "text": "and her heart was",
   "start": 34.331,
   "end": 35.107
  },
  {
   "line": 15,
   "text": "POUNDING.",
   "start": 35.242,
   "end": 35.854
  },
  {
   "line": 16,
   "text": "He'd only just noticed her, but she'd noticed him long before that.",
   "start": 36.254,
   "end": 40.067
  },
  {
   "line": 17,
   "text": "He read her face the exact same way EVERYONE reads his.",
   "start": 40.517,
   "end": 44.04
  },
  {
   "line": 18,
   "text": "Then she tells him,",
   "start": 44.3,
   "end": 45.127
  },
  {
   "line": 19,
   "text": "\"I've never once thought you were scary.\"",
   "start": 45.427,
   "end": 47.377
  },
  {
   "line": 20,
   "text": "He's used to people taking one look at his face and running.",
   "start": 47.827,
   "end": 50.513
  },
  {
   "line": 21,
   "text": "He has no idea what to do when someone looks at it...",
   "start": 50.753,
   "end": 53.364
  },
  {
   "line": 22,
   "text": "and stays.",
   "start": 53.994,
   "end": 54.77
  }
 ],
